\description{
\code{BootstrapFewShot()} runs the program on training rows, scores each output
with \code{metric}, and keeps the outputs that pass as few-shot demonstrations.
Labeled training rows can be added as demonstrations too. This is DSPy's
basic demonstration optimizer and a building block of
\code{\link[=BootstrapFewShotWithRandomSearch]{BootstrapFewShotWithRandomSearch()}} and \code{\link[=MIPROv2]{MIPROv2()}}.
